WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.504 line:0%
[driving music]

00:00:08.842 --> 00:00:11.803
[sound of wood sliding]

00:00:21.438 --> 00:00:23.773
[snapping into place]

00:00:24.441 --> 00:00:25.608
(Emma)
This was definitely a

00:00:25.608 --> 00:00:29.446
part of the degree that I was
very interested in pursuing.

00:00:29.446 --> 00:00:32.323 line:76%
One of the most important parts
of the education,

00:00:32.323 --> 00:00:34.909 line:76%
just understanding
that what you're drawing

00:00:34.909 --> 00:00:38.496 line:76%
and what you're
looking at on a plan, how that's

00:00:38.496 --> 00:00:42.208
actually physically represented
on site is extremely important.

00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:52.802
(Noah)
I've been here for like

00:00:52.802 --> 00:00:54.554
seven or so years
and I've seen these houses

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:56.639
pop up in different communities
and sort of

00:00:57.307 --> 00:00:59.517 align:end position:100% line:76%
seeing how they've changed
hands and seeing,

00:00:59.517 --> 00:01:02.395 align:end position:100% line:76%
you know, residents
living in them for years on end.

00:01:02.395 --> 00:01:05.440
You know, it does make you
sort of feel a little bit more

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:07.984
connected to communities
throughout New Haven.

00:01:07.984 --> 00:01:10.111 align:start size:66% position:34% line:50%
[snapping into place]

00:01:10.111 --> 00:01:12.822
(Adam)
What is fundamental
to architecture is shelter,

00:01:12.822 --> 00:01:15.909 align:end position:100% line:76%
and so when we're talking about
serving a population

00:01:15.909 --> 00:01:20.121 align:end position:100% line:76%
who has experienced
vulnerabilities

00:01:20.121 --> 00:01:25.543
of perhaps not having shelter,
it really foregrounds

00:01:25.543 --> 00:01:30.882
the importance of
making spaces that are both

00:01:30.882 --> 00:01:34.302
areas of refuge,
but also areas of aspiration.

00:01:34.302 --> 00:01:37.931
So it really grounds
architecture

00:01:37.931 --> 00:01:40.809
as a service to people.

00:01:40.809 --> 00:01:43.853 align:start size:6% position:94% line:7%
